    "Flasher lights Fl17-Fl28 and the full-playfield FlPf17-FlPf28 overlays, which paint flasher light and are not sockets.",
    "Baked primitives whose object origin is not a device position (origins at 0,0 or outside the playfield); the four primitives above are placed at their mesh's vertex bounds instead.",
    "The insert overlays LTnn (single-bulb lamps) and LTnna/LTnnb (two-bulb lamps): classic lights that draw the insert image over the insert's outline. The bulb-mode lights the script binds beside them (LTnna, LTnnc/LTnnd, LT67, LT68) show no bulb mesh, so they mark no socket either. The LT11b-LT13b Flasher ambience sprites lie off the playfield."
